# Session Soundtrack

This app runs a Strands `Agent` (`runtime.py`) with `@tool` catalog functions. Language: Session, album runtime, fit, listening taste, recommendation (`docs/domain/session-soundtrack.md`). Workout is the first activity type, not the product ceiling (`docs/product-later.md`). Do not add activity category trees or Spotify listening history until asked.

Required tools:

- `search_albums` — MusicBrainz discovery, then Spotify by album/artist name; no duration
- `get_album_tracks` — tracks with `duration_ms`
- `get_album_duration` — sum via `sum_duration_ms`; never a model guess. Runtime is Spotify, never MusicBrainz.

Policy: recommend only a **fit** (runtime within tolerance); JSON `AlbumPick`; no markdown. Taste ranks fits; it does not override the clock.

HTTP: `POST /runs` in `api.py`. Importing the app must not call the model. Spotify auth: read `docs/integrations/spotify.md` before touching the dashboard, Redirect URIs, or `SpotifyClient`. Client credentials only. User OAuth stays out until explicitly requested.

Prefer checking fit in code after the model returns, not only in the prompt.
